# ==============================================================================
# AntTrail - UC Irvine Degree Planner & Prerequisite Engine
# Environment Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID
# Used for private Google Drive appDataFolder synchronization with real @uci.edu accounts.
#
# How to obtain your Google Client ID:
# 1. Open Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com
# 2. Create a project (e.g., "AntTrail UCI")
# 3. Navigate to APIs & Services > Enabled APIs & Services, and enable "Google Drive API"
# 4. Navigate to APIs & Services > OAuth consent screen:
#    - Select User Type: External (or Internal if under uci.edu Google Workspace)
#    - Add scope: "https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.appdata" (Hidden app container)
# 5. Navigate to APIs & Services > Credentials > Create Credentials > OAuth client ID:
#    - Application type: Web application
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins:
#        https://anttrail-app.vercel.app
#        https://anttrail-uci.vercel.app
#        http://localhost:5173
# 6. Copy the generated Client ID and paste below:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
